msgctxt "80"
msgid "Nrgh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I didn't think you'd be much of a fight, but you've got some\r\n"
"decent moves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Hell, yeah! My teacher was a hitman named Issen. Everyone\r\n"
"knows he's basically a god!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Then why do you put on this act and threaten people for\r\n"
"pocket change?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I can't stomach killin' people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I was fine until I left my teacher and joined the family in\r\n"
"Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Whenever I tried to do my work, I got scared. I just\r\n"
"couldn't go through with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"The family threw me out, and I wound up with nowhere\r\n"
"to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "So that's why you're doing petty gigs like this now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Yeah... Anyway, it's whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"I guess I'll let the HLA take me in. I hear they can find me\r\n"
"work and stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Wait here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Why are you after me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Just calm down and come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You a cop or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I'm with the Honest Living Association."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "The HLA...? You mean that job placement center?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "More or less."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Those guys? The hell do they want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"We're going after a group of hitmen called the Reapers.\r\n"
"You're one of them, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"If you know this much, I can't very well just let you take\r\n"
"me in, now, can I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that's how you'd see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Damn... Guess there's only one thing to do, then!\r\n"
"Die, old man!"
msgstr ""

